Compare actual collection lineage, generating event/world, and mechanism evidence before surface similarity. Identify established shared origin, established independent origin, or unresolved origin with its source references. Treat duplicated or lightly edited examples as the same independence unit. Do not merge unrelated records solely because they share a label or demographic slice.
